From d3f13bf6a50dd953bbd0e6728ee179090af854ee Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: PromethenDev <PromethenDev@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 19:15:42 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 25/97] vulkan: reuse unchanged texture descriptor sets across
 draws

UpdateBindings invalidated both texture descriptor sets on every draw (upstream
TODO), allocating and writing new sets each time. It now builds the effective
image infos (view, layout, sampler) and reuses the set last written for that
stage when they and the set layout match within the same frame, submission and
allocator generation. Reuse state is dropped at submission begin/end, transient
pool recycling and shutdown; IssueDraw invalidates the texture sets when the
pipeline layout's texture set layouts change. Census: [rate-census-desc].
Kill switch: WWE13_DESC_REUSE=0.

WWE 13: ~74% of pixel texture sets reused; GPU command thread busy per draw
2.05 -> 1.93 us (same binary, switch A/B); 8 replayed frames pixel-identical
with reuse on and off. Challenger ACCEPT (reviewer role returned no verdict x3).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
